{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2220,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Climate change is boring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3830,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don’t get me wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5660,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is incredibly important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6830,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is just that the story of climate change\nis not especially compelling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10790,
    "dDurationMs": 5670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is when the carbon dioxide concentration\nreached 400 parts per million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16460,
    "dDurationMs": 4149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I started making this video I thought\nthat everyone knew the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20609,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But apparently I was wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22199,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you feel about climate change?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24619,
    "dDurationMs": 3951,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So I think Australia is the most affected\nby the climate change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28570,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is because, I would say, there are some\nlayers and layers... a hole in those layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34730,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think, I reckon, yeah?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37510,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And whereas before there used to be a natural\nlayer up there that blocks things..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41420,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That layer seems to be getting..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43870,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It is ... it is... thinner out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46080,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thinner something?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47080,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Thinner, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48080,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And so more heat is coming down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49620,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The ozone layer and therefore our seasons\nare changing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52620,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The hole in the ozone layer is causing\na problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56640,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ok, the hole in the ozone layer is a problem,\nbut it is not a major cause of climate change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61770,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To recap, we are burning fossil fuels, releasing\ncarbon dioxide into the atmosphere, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66660,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "traps slightly more thermal energy, causing\nthe overall temperature of the planet to rise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71570,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Have you changed anything about your life\nbecause climate change is happening?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75470,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I recycle now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76720,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e We recycle more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78090,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e We recycle a lot in England."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79570,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e In England, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80570,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Oh, yeah, we do more things like recycling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82170,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Recycling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83170,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Recycling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84170,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recycling plastic and paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85690,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Just putting plastics in the right bin\nand paper in the right bin and stuff like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91280,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ok, again, recycling is very important,\nbut it is not really going to reduce greenhouse"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95770,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gas emissions which come mainly from energy\nuse and transportation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100010,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what I have learned is lots of people don’t\nknow how climate change works and don’t"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103810,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know what to do about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105110,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What’s worse is there is so much confusion\nthat some people don't think humans are responsible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109420,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I am a doubter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111210,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What does that mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113049,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It means I don’t know whether it is or\nit isn’t truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115369,
    "dDurationMs": 4411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You get so many conflicting opinions on\nit they all seem to be coming from reputable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119780,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sources."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120780,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Here is the thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121970,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The vast majority of climate scientists agree\nthat climate change is happening and that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125740,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "humans are playing a significant role."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127990,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the public doesn’t see this broad consensus\nbecause, well, there are arguments made to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132990,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the contrary by businesses with vested interests,\nthose who stand to lose if a price is put"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138830,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on carbon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140110,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now these people will make up stories, whatever\nthey want, things like Al Gore and his pals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145810,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just invented climate change in order to make\nthemselves rich and famous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151280,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile the scientists respond with carefully\nworded predictions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155160,
    "dDurationMs": 6810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would result in a rising of temperature\nof between 1.4 and 2.6 degrees Celsius, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161970,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is, within a 90 percent confidence interval,\nby the year 2050."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165099,
    "dDurationMs": 3561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don’t want to listen to this story again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168660,
    "dDurationMs": 4299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why scientists have had such a tough\ntime informing the public about climate change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172959,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is much easier to tell a compelling story\nif you can make up whatever you want than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177500,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have to stick to the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179610,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Climate change is like Armageddon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181980,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just instead of a giant earth crushing asteroid\nit is slightly more of an invisible, odorless"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187780,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189250,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And instead of the immanent destruction of\nthe planet, it is a gradual warming over decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194030,
    "dDurationMs": 6030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, our brains are well adapted to deal with\nclear and present danger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200060,
    "dDurationMs": 5690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are not so good at handling complex,\nlong term, probabilistic forecasts, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205750,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is kind of why we have governments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206890,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are meant to act in our best interest,\nespecially in the case of complex, long term"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211840,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212840,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, in fact, last year the Australian government\nimplemented a carbon tax, which seemed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216220,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be working great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217220,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was reducing carbon emissions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218700,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then this year they repealed that carbon\ntax, the first government in the world to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222880,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224410,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my question is: Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226930,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, there is a UN climate summit coming\nup next month and you can actually win a trip"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231180,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go there and ask your questions to the\nworld leaders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234630,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are between the ages of 13 and 21,\nhead over to AskWhyWHyNot.org where you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239950,
    "dDurationMs": 4649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "submit a one minute video asking why, why\nnot questions, like: Why would you scrap a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244599,
    "dDurationMs": 2131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carbon tax that was working?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246730,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why not join the rest of the world in putting\na price on carbon?I mean, the real reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251180,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I find climate change boring is because we\nknow what the problem is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255590,
    "dDurationMs": 2109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The science is well established."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257699,
    "dDurationMs": 2131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the solutions are fairly obvious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259830,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet action is not being taken."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263210,
    "dDurationMs": 6239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you feel like I do, perhaps you should\ntake some action and maybe we can change this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269449,
    "dDurationMs": 12551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "story and make it a little bit more interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282000,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was sponsored by the Climate Reality\nProject, but it really opened my eyes because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286940,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really thought we already all knew the facts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290120,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But clearly we don’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292210,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe we need to spend more time educating\nthe people around us."
    } ]
  } ]
}
